window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I should have never looked into Raphael or the mysteries around him - mysteries I might never be able to solve. Stonewalled, I’ve gotten stuck when it comes to him. My roommate, my…mate; not that he knows what he really is to me. The less he knows, the better, but without being able to find him answers, I have to get back to my job. I’m at the back and call of the Tribunal, and I’ve been lax with my duties. It should have been a routine, but when someone makes enemies as dangerous as I do, nothing stays that way.</p> <p>As the world spirals out of control, I can’t help but think this has something to do with him, the mate I don’t want and the partner I’m forced to keep close. With unanswered questions swirling around me, only one thing is certain.</p> <p>I’m Kaliya Sahni, a Tribunal executioner and the last nagini. Someone wants me dead, and I walked right into their trap.</p>"; 
